1786230707428101	bones-dev	itc:v3:AWKSZJkkk5JkmZMxAAAAQatWqrq1bWwAAAE3GQ		item.comment	bn-2y5c	{"body":"Implemented in ws bn-2y5c (commit 0561eaa4). New crates/bones-cli/src/tui/selection.rs does unicode-aware word wrapping + selection math; detail pane no longer uses Paragraph::wrap. Verified end-to-end by driving the real TUI in a pty: drag across a soft wrap highlights 'click-drag text selection to the bones TUI detail pane so' + 'users can select and' and reports 'Copied 78 chars' on release. just check passes (2600 tests). Not yet merged - awaiting lead."}	blake3:cOkKbGy40_O1YlyUlpfaNcsYR2Z6VjzLe0m8FtmaS_E
