1786239178542868	bones-dev	itc:v3:AWKSZJkkk5JkmZMxAAAAQatWqrq1bWwAAAE3Gw		item.create	bn-2ssc	{"description":"The detail-pane selection highlight uses Style::default().bg(Color::Blue).fg(Color::White). Color::Blue is ANSI 4, which dark themes typically render as a very dark navy, so white-on-navy is low contrast and the selected text is hard to read.\n\nSwitch to a fixed mid-blue from the 256-color palette (indices 16-255 are not theme-remapped), so contrast is predictable across themes.","kind":"bug","title":"TUI: selection highlight too dark to read on dark themes"}	blake3:e3XrjjyBkw_9WZEvuoT_03PpdKOEIsoFPOwY3c92Eq8
